  "body_text": "俺们的手冲咖啡兴趣课\n终于开粗来啦～感激涕淋\n课程要点：\n了解咖啡豆的基本信息\n手冲咖啡器具介绍\n手冲咖啡制作流程\n演示与实际操作练习\n互相品鉴与讨论\n时间（2小时）：\n12月12日 周六10:30 - 12:30\n课程对象：刚接触手冲咖啡，没有啥方向的人儿\n人数：4 人 小班\n讲师：阿呆\n地点：上海市静安区南京西路1038号梅龙镇广场伊势丹百货5F\n有容乃大咖啡吧台\n这是我们的兴趣课程的第一站，期待～\n（器具全部是新买的，来上课的童鞋如果看中了的话可以带一套回去）\n点击👉报名",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          俺们的手冲咖啡兴趣课\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          终于开粗来啦～感激涕淋\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7R52USibu0bMyRYcPrGUzf8LzLTUZC6T5iaeTe7HusFOMiaCUYRDcM25hmgKGaL3sDNknENwDQGdn9gA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程要点：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<blockquote>\n<ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: lower-roman;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             了解咖啡豆的基本信息\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             手冲咖啡器具介绍\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             手冲咖啡制作流程\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             演示与实际操作练习\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             互相品鉴与讨论\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          时间（2小时）：\n          <strong>\n           12月12日 周六10:30 - 12:30\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程对象：刚接触手冲咖啡，没有啥方向的人儿\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          人数：4 人 小班\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          讲师：阿呆\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          地点：上海市静安区南京西路1038号梅龙镇广场伊势丹百货5F\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有容乃大咖啡吧台\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这是我们的兴趣课程的第一站，期待～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （器具全部是新买的，来上课的童鞋如果看中了的话可以带一套回去）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://j.youzan.com/WgYsAs\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"点击👉报名\">\n          点击👉报名\n         </a>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
